# Validation / release
- Run `bun x vite build` after source changes when tooling is available.
- Check `assets/.vite/manifest.json` and generated JS/CSS are consistent with the build.
- If `cybernode.local` is accessible, test only the pages/features relevant to the change, including an appropriate mobile width.
- For broad UI changes, include home, single post, search, archive, and affected TOC/FAB behavior as applicable.
- Never claim remote/cloud work was tested on `cybernode.local` unless the environment was actually accessible.
- Explicitly list checks not run and why.
- Do not produce a release ZIP before validation.
- Follow `HOW_TO_RELEASE.md` for packaging and exclusions; keep editor/debug/temp artifacts out of release packages.
- Keep functional fixes and repository-cleanup work as separate tasks when practical.